    "body": "Making the “none” branch should serve pending default reads the way Enqueue does by adding a new last step seems to do the trick:\n\n```\n4. If ! ReadableStreamHasDefaultReader(controller.[[stream]]) is true, perform ! ReadableByteStreamControllerProcessReadRequestsUsingQueue(controller).\n```\n\nIt doesn't seem to match other browser behaviour as they do it out of order, but I think this should still probably still be the direction of the spec",
